{"suttaId":"tha-ap465","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1335,1349],"vripara":"11"},"segments":{"tha-ap465:0.3":"Citakanibbāpakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap465:1.1":"“Dayhamāne sarīramhi, vessabhussa mahesino;","tha-ap465:1.3":"Gandhodakaṃ gahetvāna, citaṃ nibbāpayiṃ ahaṃ.","tha-ap465:2.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, citaṃ nibbāpayiṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap465:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, gandhodakassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap465:3.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap465:4.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap465:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap465:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā citakanibbāpako thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap465:7.1":"Citakanibbāpakattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
